Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 18:29:03 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] nuxel: instrument BridgeManager's end-session handshake

Adds EndSessionEx() which always performs the full handshake (never skips it),
raw bulk transfers that surface libusb error codes, bounded configurable
timeouts, optional hex packet tracing, and a post-session Download-Mode
presence probe. Upstream EndSession() is left untouched.
